[
  {
    "start": "00:00:03.750",
    "end": "00:00:04.960",
    "start_seconds": 3.75,
    "end_seconds": 4.96,
    "text": "When I was younger,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.960",
    "end": "00:00:07.462",
    "start_seconds": 4.96,
    "end_seconds": 7.462,
    "text": "I used to get told off in class for doodling."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:07.504",
    "end": "00:00:08.880",
    "start_seconds": 7.504,
    "end_seconds": 8.88,
    "text": "I couldn't stop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:09.506",
    "end": "00:00:12.842",
    "start_seconds": 9.506,
    "end_seconds": 12.842,
    "text": "My teacher would always stop me from doing this,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:12.884",
    "end": "00:00:16.721",
    "start_seconds": 12.884,
    "end_seconds": 16.721,
    "text": "and it was really worrying because as a creative person,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:16.763",
    "end": "00:00:18.932",
    "start_seconds": 16.763,
    "end_seconds": 18.932,
    "text": "it's something that I do naturally."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.016",
    "end": "00:00:22.686",
    "start_seconds": 20.016,
    "end_seconds": 22.686,
    "text": "After a few weeks at my art class,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:22.686",
    "end": "00:00:25.981",
    "start_seconds": 22.686,
    "end_seconds": 25.981,
    "text": "I was booked in because I was having this trouble at school."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.856",
    "end": "00:00:29.568",
    "start_seconds": 26.856,
    "end_seconds": 29.568,
    "text": "My teacher suggested something unusual."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.609",
    "end": "00:00:32.779",
    "start_seconds": 29.609,
    "end_seconds": 32.779,
    "text": "There was a big empty wall in a local restaurant."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33.238",
    "end": "00:00:35.198",
    "start_seconds": 33.238,
    "end_seconds": 35.198,
    "text": "She asked them if I could draw on it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.240",
    "end": "00:00:36.825",
    "start_seconds": 35.24,
    "end_seconds": 36.825,
    "text": "They said yes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:36.825",
    "end": "00:00:40.161",
    "start_seconds": 36.825,
    "end_seconds": 40.161,
    "text": "So I started filling the restaurant wall with my artwork."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:40.704",
    "end": "00:00:43.415",
    "start_seconds": 40.704,
    "end_seconds": 43.415,
    "text": "People would come in and watch me while they were eating."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:43.415",
    "end": "00:00:45.333",
    "start_seconds": 43.415,
    "end_seconds": 45.333,
    "text": "Photos started appearing online."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:45.709",
    "end": "00:00:48.670",
    "start_seconds": 45.709,
    "end_seconds": 48.67,
    "text": "Then the local newspaper wrote about it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:48.670",
    "end": "00:00:49.879",
    "start_seconds": 48.67,
    "end_seconds": 49.879,
    "text": "and suddenly,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49.921",
    "end": "00:00:52.799",
    "start_seconds": 49.921,
    "end_seconds": 52.799,
    "text": "people all around the world were talking about this kid"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.841",
    "end": "00:00:54.259",
    "start_seconds": 52.841,
    "end_seconds": 54.259,
    "text": "who couldn't stop doodling."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:55.051",
    "end": "00:00:56.886",
    "start_seconds": 55.051,
    "end_seconds": 56.886,
    "text": "That moment changed my life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:56.928",
    "end": "00:00:58.930",
    "start_seconds": 56.928,
    "end_seconds": 58.93,
    "text": "I wasn't even trying to be an artist,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.972",
    "end": "00:01:02.017",
    "start_seconds": 58.972,
    "end_seconds": 62.017,
    "text": "but the important thing is how it started."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.017",
    "end": "00:01:06.229",
    "start_seconds": 62.017,
    "end_seconds": 66.229,
    "text": "It started with my imagination and parents who didn't disregard"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:06.229",
    "end": "00:01:08.106",
    "start_seconds": 66.229,
    "end_seconds": 68.106,
    "text": "but embraced my passion."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:08.898",
    "end": "00:01:11.067",
    "start_seconds": 68.898,
    "end_seconds": 71.06700000000001,
    "text": "It started with the freedom to just draw."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:11.610",
    "end": "00:01:14.112",
    "start_seconds": 71.61,
    "end_seconds": 74.112,
    "text": "And that's what I want to talk about today,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.112",
    "end": "00:01:17.115",
    "start_seconds": 74.112,
    "end_seconds": 77.115,
    "text": "because the world is very different than when it was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:17.115",
    "end": "00:01:19.659",
    "start_seconds": 77.115,
    "end_seconds": 79.65899999999999,
    "text": "when I was first doodling 10 years ago."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.701",
    "end": "00:01:20.827",
    "start_seconds": 79.701,
    "end_seconds": 80.827,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:21.494",
    "end": "00:01:24.247",
    "start_seconds": 81.494,
    "end_seconds": 84.247,
    "text": "Today, it's possible to type prompts into AI,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.289",
    "end": "00:01:26.499",
    "start_seconds": 84.289,
    "end_seconds": 86.499,
    "text": "make anything and feel creative."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:27.042",
    "end": "00:01:29.085",
    "start_seconds": 87.042,
    "end_seconds": 89.08500000000001,
    "text": "But I believe there will always be value"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:29.127",
    "end": "00:01:33.506",
    "start_seconds": 89.127,
    "end_seconds": 93.506,
    "text": "in letting our imaginations be the true driver of our creations."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:34.215",
    "end": "00:01:36.551",
    "start_seconds": 94.215,
    "end_seconds": 96.551,
    "text": "Because imagination is like a muscle."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.551",
    "end": "00:01:39.095",
    "start_seconds": 96.551,
    "end_seconds": 99.095,
    "text": "The more you use it, the stronger it becomes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:39.095",
    "end": "00:01:40.513",
    "start_seconds": 99.095,
    "end_seconds": 100.513,
    "text": "But if you don't use it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.555",
    "end": "00:01:44.517",
    "start_seconds": 100.555,
    "end_seconds": 104.517,
    "text": "it gets weaker and your body will rely on something else to do it for you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:45.435",
    "end": "00:01:47.479",
    "start_seconds": 105.435,
    "end_seconds": 107.479,
    "text": "Creativity is not encouraged today."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.520",
    "end": "00:01:48.897",
    "start_seconds": 107.52000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 108.89699999999999,
    "text": "It's not given value,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:48.938",
    "end": "00:01:52.025",
    "start_seconds": 108.938,
    "end_seconds": 112.025,
    "text": "so it's easy to turn to the tools right in front of us"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:52.067",
    "end": "00:01:53.526",
    "start_seconds": 112.06700000000001,
    "end_seconds": 113.52600000000001,
    "text": "and get an instant result."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:54.152",
    "end": "00:01:56.446",
    "start_seconds": 114.152,
    "end_seconds": 116.446,
    "text": "But you don't learn by going straight to the end."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:56.488",
    "end": "00:01:57.864",
    "start_seconds": 116.488,
    "end_seconds": 117.864,
    "text": "You learn from the journey."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:58.740",
    "end": "00:02:03.244",
    "start_seconds": 118.74000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 123.244,
    "text": "Everything begins with a thought, an idea, a meaning or a vision."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.286",
    "end": "00:02:04.871",
    "start_seconds": 123.286,
    "end_seconds": 124.871,
    "text": "That's your imagination."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:04.913",
    "end": "00:02:06.039",
    "start_seconds": 124.913,
    "end_seconds": 126.039,
    "text": "The beginning."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:06.081",
    "end": "00:02:09.000",
    "start_seconds": 126.081,
    "end_seconds": 129.0,
    "text": "And that beginning influences what you do from that point."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:09.042",
    "end": "00:02:10.585",
    "start_seconds": 129.042,
    "end_seconds": 130.585,
    "text": "It's freedom."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.627",
    "end": "00:02:12.879",
    "start_seconds": 130.627,
    "end_seconds": 132.879,
    "text": "Imagination is the first step,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:12.879",
    "end": "00:02:15.256",
    "start_seconds": 132.879,
    "end_seconds": 135.256,
    "text": "and direction flows through the creation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:15.674",
    "end": "00:02:18.593",
    "start_seconds": 135.674,
    "end_seconds": 138.593,
    "text": "You're letting yourself literally wander wherever you wish."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.635",
    "end": "00:02:20.553",
    "start_seconds": 138.635,
    "end_seconds": 140.553,
    "text": "The freedom to go anywhere."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.012",
    "end": "00:02:23.765",
    "start_seconds": 141.012,
    "end_seconds": 143.765,
    "text": "Because that first step is coming from you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:23.765",
    "end": "00:02:25.475",
    "start_seconds": 143.765,
    "end_seconds": 145.475,
    "text": "and not something else."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:25.934",
    "end": "00:02:29.354",
    "start_seconds": 145.934,
    "end_seconds": 149.35399999999998,
    "text": "What I can see is we'll be reliant to replace something"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:29.396",
    "end": "00:02:31.648",
    "start_seconds": 149.39600000000002,
    "end_seconds": 151.648,
    "text": "we all need and all have."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.690",
    "end": "00:02:34.734",
    "start_seconds": 151.69,
    "end_seconds": 154.734,
    "text": "We'll be handing it off just because it's easier."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.360",
    "end": "00:02:36.569",
    "start_seconds": 155.36,
    "end_seconds": 156.56900000000002,
    "text": "And that worries me"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:36.569",
    "end": "00:02:38.947",
    "start_seconds": 156.56900000000002,
    "end_seconds": 158.947,
    "text": "because for everyone growing up around AI,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:38.947",
    "end": "00:02:42.534",
    "start_seconds": 158.947,
    "end_seconds": 162.534,
    "text": "they'll see it as normal to sacrifice their unique perspective,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:42.575",
    "end": "00:02:44.411",
    "start_seconds": 162.575,
    "end_seconds": 164.411,
    "text": "becoming more and more shaped,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:44.411",
    "end": "00:02:47.080",
    "start_seconds": 164.411,
    "end_seconds": 167.07999999999998,
    "text": "even defined, by what they can't control."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:47.872",
    "end": "00:02:50.542",
    "start_seconds": 167.872,
    "end_seconds": 170.542,
    "text": "I'm just going to show you something visually now."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:52.001",
    "end": "00:02:56.339",
    "start_seconds": 172.001,
    "end_seconds": 176.339,
    "text": "I often start my artworks with a simple shape."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:58.591",
    "end": "00:03:02.887",
    "start_seconds": 178.591,
    "end_seconds": 182.887,
    "text": "I'm thinking something spiky here."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.226",
    "end": "00:03:12.313",
    "start_seconds": 188.226,
    "end_seconds": 192.313,
    "text": "And then big eye, like this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:15.650",
    "end": "00:03:17.610",
    "start_seconds": 195.65,
    "end_seconds": 197.61,
    "text": "Then I'll add some other detail."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.862",
    "end": "00:03:21.197",
    "start_seconds": 198.862,
    "end_seconds": 201.197,
    "text": "Often when I'm creating in the moment,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21.197",
    "end": "00:03:24.367",
    "start_seconds": 201.197,
    "end_seconds": 204.367,
    "text": "it helps me feel very free,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24.409",
    "end": "00:03:27.829",
    "start_seconds": 204.409,
    "end_seconds": 207.829,
    "text": "so I can just flow with each character and each line."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.956",
    "end": "00:03:32.500",
    "start_seconds": 209.956,
    "end_seconds": 212.5,
    "text": "In New York, as I've traveled,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:32.500",
    "end": "00:03:35.837",
    "start_seconds": 212.5,
    "end_seconds": 215.837,
    "text": "I've seen lots of people on skateboards,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.879",
    "end": "00:03:37.881",
    "start_seconds": 215.879,
    "end_seconds": 217.881,
    "text": "so I'm going to draw one of them."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.018",
    "end": "00:03:51.936",
    "start_seconds": 230.018,
    "end_seconds": 231.936,
    "text": "Then I'll add the wheels in there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:04.449",
    "end": "00:04:10.330",
    "start_seconds": 244.449,
    "end_seconds": 250.33,
    "text": "Then I often like to add icons, like a heart."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.371",
    "end": "00:04:12.916",
    "start_seconds": 250.371,
    "end_seconds": 252.916,
    "text": "I feel like it's very simple but very effective."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.957",
    "end": "00:04:16.628",
    "start_seconds": 252.957,
    "end_seconds": 256.628,
    "text": "And then I love these kind of eyes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:16.628",
    "end": "00:04:19.547",
    "start_seconds": 256.628,
    "end_seconds": 259.547,
    "text": "like an alien, like that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.547",
    "end": "00:04:21.049",
    "start_seconds": 259.547,
    "end_seconds": 261.049,
    "text": "Then I'll keep this going."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.508",
    "end": "00:04:22.884",
    "start_seconds": 261.508,
    "end_seconds": 262.884,
    "text": "The arms."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:25.094",
    "end": "00:04:27.263",
    "start_seconds": 265.094,
    "end_seconds": 267.263,
    "text": "And then the legs as well."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:35.563",
    "end": "00:04:39.859",
    "start_seconds": 275.563,
    "end_seconds": 279.859,
    "text": "And with this character, I'll just start with another simple shape."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:45.824",
    "end": "00:04:47.826",
    "start_seconds": 285.824,
    "end_seconds": 287.826,
    "text": "Like so, filling this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:48.535",
    "end": "00:04:50.703",
    "start_seconds": 288.53499999999997,
    "end_seconds": 290.703,
    "text": "This guy's not very happy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.745",
    "end": "00:04:51.913",
    "start_seconds": 290.745,
    "end_seconds": 291.913,
    "text": "(Laughter)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:53.790",
    "end": "00:04:57.919",
    "start_seconds": 293.79,
    "end_seconds": 297.919,
    "text": "And then what I like to do to balance an artwork,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.961",
    "end": "00:05:02.173",
    "start_seconds": 297.961,
    "end_seconds": 302.173,
    "text": "just add lines and shapes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.215",
    "end": "00:05:04.384",
    "start_seconds": 302.215,
    "end_seconds": 304.384,
    "text": "to just fill out the space."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:14.018",
    "end": "00:05:19.482",
    "start_seconds": 314.01800000000003,
    "end_seconds": 319.48199999999997,
    "text": "And movement lines, which give life to a piece."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:19.941",
    "end": "00:05:22.610",
    "start_seconds": 319.941,
    "end_seconds": 322.61,
    "text": "Something I always use."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:55.143",
    "end": "00:06:01.190",
    "start_seconds": 355.14300000000003,
    "end_seconds": 361.19,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:02.108",
    "end": "00:06:04.360",
    "start_seconds": 362.108,
    "end_seconds": 364.36,
    "text": "I hope we can all take a step back from AI"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:04.360",
    "end": "00:06:07.363",
    "start_seconds": 364.36,
    "end_seconds": 367.363,
    "text": "and embrace what makes us truly unique,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:07.363",
    "end": "00:06:11.075",
    "start_seconds": 367.363,
    "end_seconds": 371.075,
    "text": "our ability to convert figments of our imaginations"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:11.075",
    "end": "00:06:13.620",
    "start_seconds": 371.075,
    "end_seconds": 373.62,
    "text": "and turn them into impactful realities."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:14.078",
    "end": "00:06:16.164",
    "start_seconds": 374.078,
    "end_seconds": 376.164,
    "text": "We face this choice every day."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:16.789",
    "end": "00:06:20.960",
    "start_seconds": 376.789,
    "end_seconds": 380.96,
    "text": "So let's embrace this uniqueness, this imagination,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:21.002",
    "end": "00:06:23.755",
    "start_seconds": 381.002,
    "end_seconds": 383.755,
    "text": "and the creativity that brings us all together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:23.796",
    "end": "00:06:24.964",
    "start_seconds": 383.796,
    "end_seconds": 384.964,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:24.964",
    "end": "00:06:27.050",
    "start_seconds": 384.964,
    "end_seconds": 387.05,
    "text": "(Applause and cheers)"
  }
]
